# /opt/windle/shared/x-relay.env  (chmod 600 root). Read by the `x-relay` compose service (profile "relay").
# Created by scripts/gen-secrets.sh. Variables: services/x-relay/main.go. X_RELAY_ADDR is set by compose (0.0.0.0:3010).

# Keep posts whose author carries any of these gmgn tags (kol, founder, featured, media; empty = everything).
X_RELAY_TAGS=kol,founder
X_RELAY_LOG_LEVEL=info
# Newest posts kept in memory and served by /recent (the stream snapshot is the newest 50).
# X_RELAY_CAPACITY=1000
# gmgn channels; the token channel carries founder posts the basic one may not.
# X_RELAY_CHANNELS=twitter_monitor_basic,twitter_monitor_token
# Optional egress proxy (http://user:pass@host:port) if the server IP gets blocked. Never logged.
# X_RELAY_PROXY=
# Default: a desktop Chrome UA.
# X_RELAY_USER_AGENT=
# Hold a new post this long and emit it once, merged with gmgn's later copies (0..5000; 800 covers ~98% of copies).
# X_RELAY_HOLD_MS=800
# crypto: hide replies without a crypto signal, posts under X_RELAY_MIN_TEXT chars (without @mentions and links,
# unless media + signal), and more than X_RELAY_AUTHOR_MAX posts per author per X_RELAY_AUTHOR_WINDOW.
# signal: crypto + every post needs a signal ($cashtag, CA, pump.fun/dexscreener/... link, keyword). all: no gate.
# X_RELAY_MODE=signal
# X_RELAY_MIN_TEXT=25
# X_RELAY_AUTHOR_MAX=3
# X_RELAY_AUTHOR_WINDOW=5m
# Handles whose posts are always dropped (comma-separated, case-insensitive).
# X_RELAY_DENY=
# Recently seen posts (shown or not) kept for GET /post/{id} (api: GET /v1/x/post/:id).
# X_RELAY_LOOKUP_SIZE=5000
